WEBVTT

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:15.780
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:15.780
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.200
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.200
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.180
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.180
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.640
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.640
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.940
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.940
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.320
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.320
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:59.160
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:59.160
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.710
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.710
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.520
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.520
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.860
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.860
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:50.580
THE DEATH-DEFYING SAVIOR

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:03.720
Dammit!

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:06.310
Why?! Why the hell?!

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:13.940
I'm the one who lured the Hero here!
So why am I left guarding the hostage?!

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:18.700
How'd you like to be shattered?!
Huh, little Princess?!

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:29.500
I guess I don't need to kill you now.

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:32.670
You've only got until sundown anyway.

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:54.480
Looks like there are guards.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:55.690
Let's get rid of them!

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:57.230
Hey! So suddenly?!

00:02:57.230 --> 00:02:59.320
Oh no! It's the Hero!

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:02.740
Avan Style Sword Technique, Wave Slash!

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:05.870
Run!

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:07.160
Baduck, hurry!

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:08.370
Right!

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:11.120
Okay, time for this!

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:16.250
If we can destroy this Spire
and Popp destroys the Dark Ice Spire,

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:19.010
Flazzard's Curse Field should disappear.

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:21.720
<i>I'm going to save you, Leona!</i>

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:23.300
Here we go!

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:25.260
Look out!

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:36.730
The Spire's... still standing!

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:40.110
Who did that?! Who interrupted us?!

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:48.700
Whoa! What are these guys?!

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:55.420
We're surrounded!

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:58.960
These monsters are different!
Was this a trap?!

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:05.180
Who are you?!

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:12.520
I'm Zaboera, Legion Commander of
the Mystic Legion of the Dark Army.

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:16.610
And this is Mystvearn,
Legion Commander of the Shadow Legion.

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:17.980
The Mystic Legion?!

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:19.690
The Shadow Legion?!

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:25.610
We knew you would split up
to come destroy the Spires.

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:31.500
It was the perfect opportunity
to wipe out you pesky gnats.

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:33.790
Then Popp and Maam...?!

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:40.340
Looks like we've fallen into a trap.

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:42.630
Do you think Dai and Baduck...?

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:45.840
We don't have time to worry about them!

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:47.550
We have to defeat...

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:53.680
So Dai is at the Dark Flame Spire.
How disappointing.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:58.610
It can't be...!

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:03.490
It can't be...!

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:10.120
So be it. The Disciples of Avan
will die out today either way.

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:14.080
I suppose I'll just enjoy
crushing you worms.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:15.540
Popp?

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:21.840
This... This voice...
is one I'll never forget!

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:32.010
Hadlar, the Dark Commander!

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:38.060
Not even a Hero can handle
this many enemies at once.

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:42.480
Learn to fear the Dark Army and die!

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:53.540
Very well! It's time for me to show off
the Papnica Single-Blade Style once again!

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:03.840
Baduck, try to fight just the Mages!

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:08.340
Watch out for their magic
and they're pretty weak!

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:09.720
G-Got it!

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:18.600
He's... He's the one
who killed Master Avan?!

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:25.150
Yeah. But I didn't expect
the Dark Commander himself to show up!

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:31.370
I thought I'd crush
all of you annoying creatures at once.

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:36.660
Sh-Shut up! Don't assume everything's
going to go as planned, Hadlar!

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:42.000
You're that little Mage
who was there when I killed Avan.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.960
That's right!
I'm a student of Master Avan!

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:53.550
W-What's so funny?!

00:06:55.220 --> 00:07:00.060
How hilarious! No, how very pathetic!

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.020
The scrawny little student

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:08.150
desperately fought all this way
to avenge his master...

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:12.530
only to end up dying a pitiful death!

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:18.040
S-Screw you! I may die,
but I won't go down without a fight!

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:22.960
I'll make you feel even a fraction of
the pain we felt when we lost our master.

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:29.010
That's right! We'll never forgive you
for killing our kind Master Avan!

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:31.130
Who are you?

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:34.600
I'm a student of Master Avan, too!
A Disciple of Avan!

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:39.220
You seem to have the wrong idea, girl.

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:42.600
I'm not the one who took Avan's life.

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:48.690
That primitive, ape-like emotion
called "kindness" was his undoing!

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:51.900
Why you...!

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:53.110
Maam, don't!

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:02.500
Run Maam!
He's formidable at hand-to-hand, too!

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:11.420
Maam!

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:14.430
Die.

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:28.480
<i>There's just too many of them!</i>

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:29.980
<i>In that case...!</i>

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:32.950
Avan...

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:40.740
Dai!

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:50.090
<i>H-He floats like a ghost,
but he's so strong!</i>

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:52.420
<i>Who is he?!</i>

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:58.430
Th-This is...

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:01.180
Dark Puppetry Aura Hand?!

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:07.980
B-But this was Hyunckel's skill!

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:15.070
You fool. Hyunckel may have learned
his sword skills from Avan,

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:20.370
but he learned how to control
Dark Aura from Mystvearn.

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:23.370
For controlling skeletons.

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:29.290
In other words, Mystvearn
is the originator of that skill!

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:31.880
<i>I-I can't move!</i>

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:33.590
Dai!

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:38.470
Whoops! You aren't
going anywhere, you old goat!

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:43.600
Shut up! I won't let
an old gremlin call me an old goat!

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:48.810
Having an old fossil like you
running around is even more annoying!

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:53.280
Let my words of death
lead you to an eternal slumber!

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:54.570
Thwack!

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:05.160
W-What is this creepy voice?!

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:09.290
These are words of death
calling to you from the netherworld.

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:14.630
When you succumb to them, your life ends!

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:18.840
Now die, die, die!

00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:34.570
CRACKLE
ICE-TYPE SPELL

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:39.570
DARK PUPPETRY AURA HAND

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:51.670
Popp...

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:56.960
Dammit. Hadlar's spell
is even stronger than last time!

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:58.130
How?!

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:00.380
Isn't it obvious?

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:03.010
As a reward for killing Avan,

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:08.480
Dark King Vearn granted me a new body,
allowing me to power up!

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:12.020
In combat, spells, and everything!

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:20.110
In other words, I'm even stronger now
than when I killed Avan!

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:21.990
No...

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:28.950
So, now you see that
you have no hope for survival.

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:34.710
I'm sure Dai has already been pummeled
by the Mystic and Shadow Legions,

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:38.050
and is dead by now.

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:42.720
<i>It's no good.</i>

00:11:42.890 --> 00:11:45.350
<i>We can't... We can't beat him!</i>

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:52.100
<i>Maybe if it was just Flazzard. But with
Hadlar and the other Legions here...</i>

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:54.560
<i>It's all over.</i>

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:59.650
You insects! For the crime of
standing up against our great Dark Army,

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:02.200
death is not enough!

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:04.700
Sizzle?!

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:10.790
Taste pain worse than death
from my inferno!

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:21.720
Maam!

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:28.470
<i>That's right... I can't give up!</i>

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:34.140
<i>If I give up,
who's going to protect Maam?!</i>

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:37.860
Burn to ashes together!

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:42.320
I have to protect Maam.

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:46.070
I have to go help Dai!

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:48.910
Sizzle!

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:55.670
I can't give up! Not until the very end!

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:03.340
What?!

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:11.720
I cast Sizzle!

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:16.650
I-Impossible!

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:28.820
Impossible! That brat's spell
overpowered my own?!

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:31.120
Lord Hadlar, are you alright?!

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:32.910
Shut up!

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:37.290
Now's my chance! They're disorganized!

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:39.380
What can I use?! Anything?!

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:40.920
Curse you, boy!

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:42.380
We'll take him!

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:45.220
All of you back off!

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:49.850
Sizzle!

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:04.440
I did it! Maam, did you see that?!

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:10.780
It was amazing.
I can't believe you cast Sizzle.

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:14.240
Me too. I wasn't even thinking.

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:16.290
It's all thanks to my mentor!

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:22.420
It was just one day of training,
but my attack spells increased in power!

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:26.470
<i>Thank you, Mentor!</i>

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:33.140
The Dark Ice Spire can come later.
Let's go help Dai and Baduck.

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:34.260
Yeah.

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:55.290
What a surprise.
How that snotty little brat has grown.

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:15.390
But now observe and know
that there's always a bigger fish!

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:18.060
No way! That's...!

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:21.600
Oh? You recognize this spell?

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:24.440
You've done your Mage homework.

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:26.230
Run, Maam!

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:28.610
Kasizz!

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:42.000
W-What's that?!

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:49.920
That is the sound of Lord Hadlar
using his most powerful spell, Kasizz.

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:51.510
Hadlar's here?!

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:57.390
The Dark Ice Spire is guarded by
Lord Hadlar himself and his minions.

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:59.680
Hadlar is fighting Popp and Maam?!

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:01.850
Darn it!

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:06.400
Futile! Pure futility!

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:12.320
No one can break free from
Mystvearn's Dark Puppetry Aura Hand!

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:16.830
Now let's see which of you dies first.

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:25.580
Yes!

00:16:31.220 --> 00:16:32.050
Baduck!

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:35.300
Gomechan!

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:42.890
C-Curse you and your useless resistance!

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:50.320
This time, we'll end it all at once!

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:55.410
Gomechan, Baduck...

00:16:55.820 --> 00:17:00.330
I'm not sure if I have the strength
to defend both of you.

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:01.790
I'm sorry.

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:05.000
Fear not! If we die, we die together!

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:10.210
All of you! Attack!

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:26.060
Wh-Who was that?!
Who dares to do such a thing?!

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:27.650
I do!

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:33.280
I-Impossible!

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:40.990
Beast King Crocodine!

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:47.330
Y-You! First you disappear
without a trace,

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:53.710
then you show up and drop a boulder
on us?! What's the meaning of this?!

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:55.510
I'm helping the Disciples of Avan.

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:57.260
W-What?!

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:02.680
I couldn't just sit back
and let you ambush them.

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:04.310
Have you lost your mind?!

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:08.940
All of you!
Take care of that traitor first!

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:12.610
Take care of me? You're joking!

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:17.570
As if you small fry
could defeat the Beast King!

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:27.080
What the heck is this giant monster?!

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:28.830
Crocodine!

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:29.790
Dai!

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:31.460
You were alive!

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:35.340
As you can see! I'm here to help you!

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:38.010
That's right! Popp and Maam are in danger!

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:39.010
Hadlar is...

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:43.260
Fear not. A powerful ally
is headed for the Dark Ice Spire.

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:46.770
And he's even more powerful than I am!

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.230
Huh?!

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:59.320
L-Lord Hadlar, you're safe...

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:00.700
Indeed.

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:09.460
They still remain.

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:13.250
Well, I had to hold back to spare
the Dark Ice Spire after all.

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:18.880
She's still breathing. I should
strangle her to death just in case.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:19.970
Wa...

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:21.510
Wait...

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:25.310
You survived, too?

00:19:25.470 --> 00:19:29.810
Don't worry. You'll soon
see each other in the afterlife.

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:32.480
Please...

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:36.940
I don't... I don't care
what happens to me.

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:40.150
Just...

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:44.660
Just, please, let her go.

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:48.660
Is this the "kindness" you speak of?

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:51.960
Please... Not Maam...

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:59.130
I see. You're in love with this girl.

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:03.890
This is great!

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:05.430
Please...

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:08.810
Knowing that,
I can't possibly let her live now.

00:20:10.350 --> 00:20:14.860
You little maggot, you scarred my body.

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:21.530
Now watch
as the girl you love dies horribly.

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:27.200
This is the most fitting
punishment for you.

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:29.040
Don't...

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:35.000
I'll impale her body
on the top of the Dark Ice Spire.

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:36.290
Don't!

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:40.010
Please don't!

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:45.840
Maam!

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:05.030
The Dark Ice Spire fell?!

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:21.800
You're...!

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:28.760
The Dark Ice Spire...

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:30.560
Well done, Hyunckel.

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:31.970
So it really is Hyunckel!

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:34.980
Now, Dai, I'll shatter
the Dark Flame Spire!

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:37.650
You go on ahead to Valge Tower!

00:21:37.810 --> 00:21:38.690
Right!

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:41.860
Go kick Flazzard's butt!

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:53.250
Hyunckel... you're alive?!

00:21:53.910 --> 00:21:55.790
You...

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:25.990
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:25.990
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:32.990
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:32.990
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:36.210
<i>I'm not sure</i>

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:36.210
<i>doudarou</i>

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:44.170
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:44.170
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

00:22:44.340 --> 00:22:46.720
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

00:22:44.340 --> 00:22:46.720
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:52.810
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:52.850
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:57.520
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:57.560
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

00:22:57.560 --> 00:23:01.770
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

00:22:57.690 --> 00:23:01.730
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

00:23:01.770 --> 00:23:08.240
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

00:23:01.900 --> 00:23:08.200
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:14.030
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:14.080
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:19.370
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:19.330
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:36.560
<i>The one who saved Maam</i>

00:23:36.600 --> 00:23:40.770
<i>was Hyunckel, the Undead Legion Commander
who vanished at the Underground Palace.</i>

00:23:40.940 --> 00:23:44.730
<i>Hadlar's anger explodes
at Hyunckel's betrayal of the Dark Army.</i>

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:48.280
<i>Hyunckel seeks to avenge the death
of his father, Bartos.</i>

00:23:48.530 --> 00:23:52.820
<i>Their incredible showdown begins at last.</i>

00:23:53.320 --> 00:23:55.580
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:55.740 --> 00:23:57.620
<i>"Hyunckel Versus Hadlar"</i>

00:23:57.790 --> 00:23:59.870
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
